source        "https://github.com/commaai/opendbc opendbc/dbc/car_motorola.dbc at commit 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567"
source        "Linux UAPI header include/uapi/linux/can.h, struct can_frame (GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note)"
uses          dbccarmotorola
